      "afterUTF8": "\"\"\"Finite account-profile API bridge for an existing admitted consumer.\n\nEvery callback retains one exact compiler-qualified profile and the caller's\nexisting command barrier. This module does not instantiate Consumer, select or\nreplace its stage/write namespace, or own any process/simulator lifecycle. The\nexisting corrected consumer keeps those obligations and any first-error writer.\n\"\"\"\n",
